# RichOS optional private machine settings. Literal KEY=value, no quotes or expansion.
# Open ~/Library/Application Support/RichOS/.env with your editor or Finder Go to Folder.
# Blank/commented settings use portable defaults. Existing files are never overwritten.
# An explicitly required storage volume must be mounted; it never falls back internally.
# RICHOS_BULK_ROOT must already exist. Children are tmp/claude, caches and state/richos.
# Environment values win per key. A component override wins over a bulk-derived path.
# Cargo alias order: explicit argument, RICHOS_CARGO_CACHE_ROOT, CARGO_TARGET_DIR, bulk/default.
# Add new keys to both readers/forwarding together. Activate only with compatible consumers.
# RICHOS_BULK_ROOT=
# CARGO_TARGET_DIR=
# RICHOS_CARGO_CACHE_ROOT=
# SCCACHE_DIR=
# RICHOS_SCCACHE_TMPDIR=
# RICHOS_BUILD_CACHE=
# RICHOS_RECOVERY_EVIDENCE_ROOT=
# RICHOS_RECOVERY_WIP_ROOT=
# RICHOS_CPU_GUARD_STATE=
# RICHOS_ENGINE_PASS_DIR=
# RICHOS_PROOF_RUN_DIR=
# RICHOS_AUTOCHECK_PROOF_ROOT=
# RICHOS_TEST_RESULTS_ROOT=
# RICHOS_ANDROID_CACHES_ROOT=
# RICHOS_NATIVE_IOS_CACHE=
# RICHOS_NATIVE_ANDROID_CACHE=
# RICHOS_GPL_SOURCE_CACHE=
